{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも読んでくださってる方、\n初めて読んでくださった方、\nコメントしてくださった方、\nありがとうございます:)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はOFFでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校休みになると平気で\n昼まで寝れちゃうわね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/10/8970696/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はいとこの家に行ってきました^^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー\nいとこの部屋落ち着くで。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/10/8970696/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりにお団子してみーたっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/10/8970696/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近マキシのワンピばっか着てる‼\nこの前もスウェットのロングスカート買ったのー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/10/8970696/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えっ、ちゃうよ\n部屋着じゃない部屋着じゃない笑\nスウェットでもちゃんと私服で着るわよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/10/8970696/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーショッピングしたいなぁ。\n高円寺の古着屋行きたいなぁ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また今度私服載せます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/10/8970696/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てへぺろ\n↑「てへぺろ」の使い方をいまいち理解できてない人"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊＊＊\n東日本大震災復興支援\nチャリティーイベント"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「いま、私たちにできること」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3月17日にZEPP東京で\nチャリティーイベントを行います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日、3月11日は今も忘れられない\n大地震が起こった日です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"被災地で生活している方々の力に\n少しでもなれたら良いな\nと思っています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ、参加して\n一緒に日本を元気にしましょう‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊＊＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/10/8970696/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あえて落書きしないでみた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/10/8970696/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまにはいいだろっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/10/8970696/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/10/8970696/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前髪伸びたな..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では‼\n今日はお疲れさまりか＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しゅわっち"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/10/8970696/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベビたん*****bA by marika"}],"source":"archive"}